{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108470","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1510847001:0":{"text":"うっ……また余計なところを削ってしまった。","source_cn":"啧……又多凿了一刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA2CD6B35F435802","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510847002:0":{"text":"石を削るのがこんなに難しいとは。<style=\"highlight\">獣人たちが石の彫刻を彫って愛を伝える</style>理由が、分かった気がするよ……","source_cn":"没想到石雕居然这么难做，难怪<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD028F78F76898E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510847003:0":{"text":"これでは、とても本人に見せられないな……はぁ、俺も魔法が使えたらよかったんだが。","source_cn":"露要是看到我把她雕成这副样子……唉，要是我也会魔法就好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C6B45EB5016A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510847004:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">未完成の彫刻を一つに組み合わせる</style>魔法だってあるはずだ。","source_cn":"肯定有什么魔法能<style=highlight>把这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D97AEA60E3274D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510847005:0":{"text":"……だめだ、まずは落ち着こう。焦ってもいいことはない。","source_cn":"算了，珀尔修斯，还是先静下心来吧。这件事不能急躁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5C75400F3CA841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor